        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Exceptions to the seniority provisions herein may be made by mutual agreement between the Business Labor Relations Representative and the Senior Business Representative or Assistant Senior Business Representative or their designated representatives. The Employer shall in any event always have the right to maintain in each Classification a sufficient number of qualified employees to maintain work schedules and operations, and shall also have the right to retain an employee who possesses a particular skill or special training.",
            "block_bbox": [
